# Architecture (Goofy Ball / Godot 4.7)

Side-view volleyball prototype. Prefer the smallest change that fits existing patterns. Do not invent parallel systems.

Godot 4.x only: `@export`/`@onready`, `signal.connect(cb)`, `instantiate()`, typed GDScript, `Input` actions.

## Stable references (critical)

- Prefer `class_name` + typed use over `preload("res://path/script.gd")`
- Prefer `@export` / `@export_file` / PackedScene assigned in the editor
- Do not add new path constants for scripts/resources unless no other option

## Target platforms

Ship for **Mobile**, **desktop**, **HTML5**. Prefer InputMap actions; keep UI readable on phone landscape.
Touch (`virtual_controls`) is **P1 only** (left half move, right half jump) — local same-screen 2P is not dual-player touch.


## #1 Scene isolation (critical)

**Every scene must open and run alone in the editor without crashes.**

- Bake safe defaults into **Resource files** (`.tres`) and `@export` them
- Parents override at runtime via events / `initialize(data)` + `ResourceUtils.update_resource`
- No required autoloads or sibling scenes to boot

## Entry & folders

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `main.tscn` → `src/game/main.gd` | HFSM bootstrap host |
| `src/game/scenes/` | Screens: `app_root`, `menu`, `game`, `post_battle` |
| `src/features/` | Isolated gameplay (`blob_player`, `ball`, `ai_opponent`, `virtual_controls`) |
| `src/common/` | Shared Resources (`GameConfig`, settings) |
| `src/ui/` | Shared UI (loading screen) |
| `core/` | Project-agnostic (HFSM, FSM, EventListener, ResourceUtils) |
| `addons/GodotSavesAddon` | Save plugin — do not edit casually |

## Layer contracts

### `src/features/`
- One folder = one feature; keep deps inside
- Public surface: signals `ev_*`, `initialize`/`setup`, exported scenes
- Features must not import other features' internals

### `core/`
- Must not depend on `src/`

### `src/game/scenes/`
- Orchestration only; wire features + config
- Each scene ships default Resources; parents override via `RootEvents`

## Context flow

```
Menu --ev.start_game--> Battle --ev.exit_game--> PostBattle
PostBattle --ev.return_to_menu--> Menu
PostBattle --ev.start_game--> Battle (retry)
```

- `main.gd` boots HFSM only
- `app_root` bridges `RootEvents` → `hfsm.add_event`
- Battle payload: `{ "custom_battle": GameConfig }` (vs_ai flag inside)
- In-match: `GameEvents` + `GameManager` FSM (not HFSM)

## Match loop

`GameManager` FSM: `Serve` → `Play` → `Point` → (`Serve` | `MatchEnd`).
Do not drive win/lose with ad-hoc flags outside the FSM.

## Placement

- New gameplay unit → `src/features/{name}/`
- New screen → `src/game/scenes/{name}/`
- Shared Resource → `src/common/`
- Generic util → `core/lib/`
- Progress disk write only via `RootEvents.ev_save_progress` → `SaveManager`
- Mobile/Web quality: `PerformanceTune` (disable glow/fog/sun-shadows/omni fill, 3D scale 0.7)
